QihpK5p2JoyubLXw&oe=6A8AE5EC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Plumbing Technician", "keywords": ["Plumbing", "Immerselearn", "Training"], "long_description": "Plumbing Technician is part of the Immerse Learn Plumbing Technician Certification Program and is accessible only to students enrolled in the program. This VR simulation delivers a comprehensive, hands-on learning experience in plumbing techniques and system operations. Training modules include pipe and fittings, water distribution, and drainage systems; installation and maintenance of plumbing fixtures; interpreting plumbing drawings; installation of drains; backflow prevention; valve types and applications; safety regulations; and troubleshooting plumbing systems, including working with electricity in plumbing. Learners also gain experience in the use and maintenance of plumbing tools, fire extinguisher use, and system protection methods. Developed to align with industry standards, Plumbing Technician provides a safe, immersive environment for students to strengthen technical expertise, improve safety awareness, and build practical skills for real-world plumbing careers. Access is restricted to enrolled students only.\n ", "short_description": "Plumbing Technician is a VR training app developed as part of the Immerse Learn Plumbing Technician Certification Program. Available exclusively to enrolled students, it provides hands-on training in plumbing fundamentals, including tools, drawings, pipe systems, fixture installations, safety practices, and troubleshooting\u2014all in a realistic virtual environment.\n "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Immerse Learn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerselearn.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "